OL,3,GNEWSAMan became town crier after wife's
OL,4,A'big gob' jibe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man says he became a town crier after
OL,7,Fhis wife told him "you'd be good at
OL,8,Fthat because you've got a big gob".
OL,10,FKevin Ruane has been the Southport and
OL,11,FSefton borough town crier for less than
OL,12,F18 months.
OL,14,FHe said his wife Sam's words of
OL,15,Fencouragement came as they watched the
OL,16,FKnaresborough town crier in action
OL,17,Fduring a visit to the market town in
OL,18,FNorth Yorkshire.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
